<MessageStudioText
	Format="1.2" xmlns="nintendo:msgstudio">
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p08_fesguide_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>Cギアが　あれば
ひとりでも！　みんなとでも！▼
ゆかいな　フェスミッションが
たのしめまーす！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T06:19:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T03:53:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>Ｃ－ＧＥＡＲが　あれば
一人でも！　みんなとでも！▼
愉快な　フェスミッションが
楽しめまーす！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-11T02:59:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T03:53:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・フェスミッション用
・GRIDX＝12、GRIDZ＝24に配置
・Ｃギア入手前
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T06:22:48" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>？？？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T03:53:23" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>unknown</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T13:24:32" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#404040</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p08_fesguide_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そこの　あなた
ハイリンクは　ごぞんじ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T06:10:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T04:04:01" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そこの　あなた
ハイリンクは　ご存知？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T06:19:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T04:04:01" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・フェスミッション用
・Ｃギア入手後＋チュートリアル終了前
　pos起動
　GRIDX＝13~19、GRIDZ＝24
・Ｃギアの電源オフ→fesguide_03
・ハイリンク初回訪問イベントを未消化
　→fesguide_04
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T06:23:13" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>？？？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T04:04:01" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>unknown</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T13:24:34" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#404040</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p08_fesguide_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あら？　Ｃギアの　でんげんを
オンに　してもらえるかしら？▼
Ｃギアの　がめん　みぎしたに
あるのが　でんげんボタン　なのよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T06:16:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T05:56:53" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あら？　Ｃ－ＧＥＡＲの　電源を
ＯＮに　してもらえるかしら？▼
Ｃ－ＧＥＡＲの　画面　右下に
あるのが　電源ボタン　なのよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T06:34:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T06:15:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・Cギアの電源オフ
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T06:10:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>？？？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T05:53:35" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>unknown</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T13:24:34" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#404040</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p08_fesguide_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>Ｃギアに　[System:Color name="1" ]ワイヤレスボタン[/System:Color]　が
あるから　おしてごらんなさい▼
それから　[System:Color name="1" ]ハイリンク[/System:Color]　という
ボタンを　おすと　いいわよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T06:13:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T06:01:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>Ｃ－ＧＥＡＲに　[System:Color name="1" ]ワイヤレスボタン[/System:Color]　が
あるから　押してごらんなさい▼
それから　[System:Color name="1" ]ハイリンク[/System:Color]　という
ボタンを　押すと　いいわよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T06:20:52" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T06:15:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・ハイリンク初回訪問イベントを未消化
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T06:01:34" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>？？？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-19T05:53:35" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>unknown</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T13:24:34" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
